  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">SGP-OP8 builds on 30 years of empowering local CSOs and CBOs through community-driven actions that improve wellbeing, resilience, and environmental benefits. It engages local actors in landscape-seascape approaches across 99 countries, offering knowledge, capacity building, and grant support to enhance livelihoods and generate global environmental gains.Under GEF-8, resources are shared equally among eligible countries. The strategy&#x2014;through four outcomes&#x2014;advances SGP 2.0, emphasizing youth, wome</narrative>
  </description>
